{
  "id": "02",
  "title": "Quick Start",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05) 100%); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 48px; border-radius: 8px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading);\">Get started with Gravito in under 5 minutes. Build your first route, controller, and understand the three rendering paths available in the framework.</p></div><h2>Installation</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 18v-8z\"></path><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Standalone Photon</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">For lightweight applications, install Photon directly:</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>bun add @gravito/photon</code></pre></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Full Framework</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">For production applications with the full ecosystem:</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>bun add @gravito/core</code></pre></div></div><h2>Your First Route</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Routes live in <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">src/routes/web.ts</code> (or <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">api.ts</code>). The API is clean and chainable.</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Standalone Photon</h3><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>import { Photon } from '@gravito/photon'\n\nconst app = new Photon()\n\napp.get('/', (c) => {\n  return c.json({ \n    status: 'accelerating', \n    version: '1.5.0' \n  })\n})\n\nBun.serve({\n  port: 3000,\n  fetch: app.fetch\n})</code></pre></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">With PlanetCore</h3><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>import { Route } from '@gravito/core'\n\nRoute.get('/hello', () => 'Hello Gravito!')</code></pre></div><h2>Using Controllers</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">As your logic grows, move it into controllers for better organization. Generate one with the CLI:</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px;\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"></polyline><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\"></line><polyline points=\"10 9 9 9 8 9\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Step 1: Generate Controller</h3></div><pre style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>bun gravito make:controller UserController</code></pre><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px;\"><polyline points=\"16 18 22 12 16 6\"></polyline><polyline points=\"8 6 2 12 8 18\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Step 2: Define Handler</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">In <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">src/controllers/UserController.ts</code>:</p><pre style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>import { Context } from '@gravito/core'\n\nexport class UserController {\n  async index(c: Context) {\n    return c.json({ message: 'Hello from controller' })\n  }\n}</code></pre><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px;\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"></path><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Step 3: Register Route</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">In <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">src/routes/web.ts</code>:</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>import { UserController } from '../controllers/UserController'\n\nRoute.get('/users', [UserController, 'index'])</code></pre></div><h2>Three Rendering Paths</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito lets you switch modes per page, giving you the flexibility to choose the best approach for each use case:</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">A</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Fullstack SPA</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Inertia.js + React/Vue for complex dashboards and admin panels.</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px;\"><code>index(c: Context) {\n  const inertia = c.get('inertia')\n  return inertia.render('UserProfile', { \n    name: 'John Doe' \n  })\n}</code></pre></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">B</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Classic MPA</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Template engine for SEO-friendly pages, blogs, and landing pages.</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px;\"><code>index(c: Context) {\n  const view = c.get('view')\n  return view.render('welcome', { \n    title: 'My Site' \n  })\n}</code></pre></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">C</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">API Only</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Lightweight microservices for pure API backends and mobile apps.</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px;\"><code>index(c: Context) {\n  return c.json({ status: 'ok' })\n}</code></pre></div></div><h2>Database & Migrations</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito ships with <strong>Atlas ORM</strong> for powerful database operations:</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Run Migrations</h3></div><pre style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code># Execute all pending migrations\nbun gravito migrate\n\n# Create a new migration\nbun gravito make:migration create_posts_table</code></pre><div style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading);\">Tip:</strong> See the <a href=\"/docs/atlas\" style=\"color: #FFB800; text-decoration: underline;\">Atlas ORM documentation</a> for complete database operations, relationships, and query builder usage.</p></div></div><h2>Interactive REPL (Tinker)</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Test your application interactively with the built-in REPL:</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>bun gravito tinker</code></pre><p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">This opens an interactive shell where you can test routes, query the database, and experiment with your application logic.</p></div><h2>Next Steps</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; transition: all 0.2s ease; cursor: pointer;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #FFB800;\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"></path><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"></path></svg><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Core Concepts</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Dive deeper into Gravito's architecture and design patterns.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; transition: all 0.2s ease; cursor: pointer;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #FFB800;\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Routing System</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Explore advanced routing patterns and middleware.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; transition: all 0.2s ease; cursor: pointer;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #FFB800;\"><path d=\"M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 18v-8z\"></path><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Project Structure</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Learn about organizing your Gravito application.</p></div></div>",
